This file records the license of the vendored third-party file in this directory:

    r7rs-tests.scm -- from chibi-scheme, tests/r7rs-tests.scm

That file is kept byte-for-byte identical to upstream (see README.md and
test/r7rs/r7rs-tests.sha256), so its license cannot be carried in a header
without breaking the checksum that ties it to the manifests. It is reproduced
here instead, verbatim from chibi-scheme's COPYING, which satisfies condition 1
below for a source redistribution.

Emit itself is MIT-licensed; see the LICENSE file at the repository root.

